tence is now over, as he has found a companion in Mana. And Mana, who had been trapped in a small hut her whole life, finds delight in even the simplest of things. Together, Yuta and Mana attempt to seek out more mermaids, trying to become normal humans again.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Mermaid","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":60,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Mermaid Forest (TV)","english":"Mermaid Forest (TV)","native":"高橋留美子劇場 人魚の森","romaji":"Takahashi Rumiko Gekijou: Ningyo no Mori","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"人鱼之森"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Takahashi Rumiko Gekijou Ningyo no Mori"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"人鱼森林"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Mermaid's Forest"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}